    box rgb(235,250,240) Hyperledger FireFly
        %% C4: Core=firefly.core
        participant Core as FireFly Core<br/>[Container]<br/>Go
        %% C4: EVM=firefly.evm
        participant EVM as EVMConnect<br/>+ FFTM<br/>[Container]<br/>Go
